    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be a continuous function and let <math><mi>g</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as<br /><math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> . Then",
